    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get what you're saying about the tetanus but honestly it's a small puncture and i feel fine right now. going to a clinic is such a hassle. is there anything else i can do to make sure it stays clean? like maybe i could use some peroxide or something to really kill the bacteria in there? and i really want to close it up so it stops oozing, can i just use some kind of glue or a heavy ointment to seal it so it heals faster?",
