      "content": "okay but i really dont want to leave it open and just oozing all day while i work. if i cant use superglue, can i at least put a thick layer of antibiotic ointment on it and then put a really tight bandage over it? i feel like if i just pack it with ointment and wrap it tight it'll keep everything sterile and won't let anything get in. thats safe right? i just want to fix it now so i can get back to my garden.",
